  "description": "A vintage letterman jacket brings a retro-inspired look to everyday outfits. This navy and gold version suits wearers who prefer a leather shirt collar, with matching cuffs and waistband completing the classic color combination.\n\nDetails\n- Body: navy 24 oz melton wool\n- Sleeves: gold genuine cowhide leather\n- Collar: leather shirt collar; navy and gold knit cuffs and waistband\n- Lining: quilted lining\n- Closure: snap-button front\n- Pockets: two welt pockets\n- Fit: True-to-size fit; compare your measurements with the size guide\n- Sizes: XXS through 6XL\n\nCustomization options\n- Chenille letter and name embroidery\n- Number, patches and back lettering\n- Free digital design proof before production.\n\nExplore vintage varsity jacket styling or letterman jacket with collar styling or retro letterman jacket with your own personal details. Choose your layout through our [custom letterman jacket](/custom-letterman-jackets) options and review the placement before production.\n\nProduction and delivery\nMade in our Sialkot factory. Made in 6–7 business days after design approval. Delivery in 5–7 business days.",
